post.description:
Driver sign-up (D-01). The account stays PENDING_VERIFICATION until the OTP is checked.

Inputs: {"full_name", "phone", "email", "password", "hub_id", "vehicle_plate", "license_no"}
Outputs: {"phone_hint", "expires_at", "resend_available_at", "demo_code" (demo only)}
Errors: EMAIL_TAKEN, PHONE_TAKEN, HUB_NOT_FOUND, VALIDATION_ERROR

get.description:
Driver home (D-04).

Outputs: {"date", "hub", "availability", "shifts_today", "upcoming",
          "active_orders", "delivered_today"}

post.description:
Register for a shift.

Inputs: {"shift_id", "work_date": "2026-10-26"}
Errors: SHIFT_NOT_FOUND, SHIFT_CLOSED, SHIFT_FULL, SHIFT_OVERLAP, ALREADY_REGISTERED

get.description:
Today's work: parcels to collect first, then stops in delivery order.

Outputs: {"hub_name", "hub_lat", "hub_lng", "driver_lat", "driver_lng",
          "to_pick_up": [order], "ready_to_start", "stops": [stop]}

post.description:
Offer the order to a chosen driver; the driver still has to accept (FR-H-01).

Inputs: {"driver_id"}
Errors: INVALID_TRANSITION (parcel already picked up), DRIVER_NOT_AVAILABLE, DRIVER_BUSY

Set category and priority (UC-03 step 2, BR13).

Inputs: {"category": "OBJECTIVE" | "SUBJECTIVE", "priority": "LOW" | "MEDIUM" | "HIGH"}
Errors: INCIDENT_CLOSED

Apply a solution (BR15).

Inputs: {"solution": "ROUTE_SUGGESTED", "stop_ids": [...]}
        {"solution": "DRIVER_REASSIGNMENT", "driver_id", "order_ids": [...] | null}
        {"solution": "HOLD_AT_HUB", "note"}
Errors: INCIDENT_NOT_CLASSIFIED, RESPONSE_REQUIRED, INCIDENT_CLOSED,
        DRIVER_NOT_AVAILABLE, DRIVER_BUSY

Upload one image (multipart field `file`).

Errors: FILE_TYPE (only JPEG/PNG/WebP), FILE_TOO_LARGE (> 5 MB), FILE_EMPTY
Outputs: {"id", "url", "mime", "size_bytes"}

get.description:
Search accounts.

Inputs (query): q (name, e-mail or phone), role, hub_id, status, page, page_size
Outputs: {"items": [UserOut], "total", "page", "page_size"}

post.description:
Create an account of any role.

Errors: EMAIL_TAKEN, PHONE_TAKEN, HUB_REQUIRED, DRIVER_FIELDS_REQUIRED
Outputs: {"user": UserOut, "temporary_password": "..." | null}

put.description:
Replace the permission set of a role.

Inputs: {"permissions": ["report.view", ...], "force_relogin": false}
Errors: UNKNOWN_PERMISSION, LOCKOUT_PREVENTED (SYSTEM_ADMIN must keep role/user management)
